  designNotes: "2026-09-02, Meshy AI attack (\u626D\u8F49\u524D\u5288.zip, take \"Scene\",
    2.03s) imported as Wushi_TwistCleave - a twisting forward cleave. Measured offline
    on the live 4x \u6B66\u58EB: an early swing nt 0.15 (blade reach 4.1, speed 41)
    then a big committed cleave nt 0.40-0.50 (blade reach spikes 8.8m, speed peak
    63 at nt 0.45). Hips forward-drift 0 -> ~6.6m baked into the body pose (Meshy
    clip quirk, lockRootPositionXZ does not remove it) -> cancelClipBodyDrift=1 anchors
    the visible body; lungeDistanceFromTargetGap (gap-1.6m, clamp 0..4) drives a
    short commit over nt 0.10-0.45. isMajorAttack (heavy, longer rest after). deflectReaction
    ContinueCombo, knockback 0 per session rules. NEEDS PLAY TUNING: hit window nt
    (the big cleave contact), lungeTargetGapMeters, drift-cancel visual."
